# What `git archive` leaves out, which includes the "Source code" archives GitHub attaches to a
# tag or release.
#
# `export-ignore` affects `git archive` only. It does not change what a clone sees, and it does
# not change the sdist on PyPI: hatchling builds that from pyproject.toml and .gitignore.

# Claude Code configuration: the hook a cloud session runs to load Masterly's project-wide agent
# guidance from a clone alongside this one, and the settings entry that registers it. Nothing a
# user of the package needs.
/.claude        export-ignore
